      <tei:div type="colophon" subtype="notes">
        <tei:p>This is an English translation prepared by Devra Kay for an unidentified tkhine for a pregnant woman (see Devra Kay, <tei:hi rend="italic">Seyder Tekhines: The Forgotten Book of Jewish Prayer for Jewish Women</tei:hi>, Jewish Publication Society, 2004, p.162-164). Kay’s scope of tkhine literature spans the period of works published between 1640 and 1720, so we expect the work from which her translation was derived to be attested among the Seder Tkhines of this period. If you can identify the eact text or volume, from which this translation was derived, please contact us.</tei:p>
      </tei:div>
